      "title": {
        "en": "Exceptional coat cuts and styling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners in Prospect Heights praise the spa for immaculate haircuts, beautifully brushed coats, and clean-smelling finishes. Stylists successfully resolve dense matting on both long-haired cats and dogs while preserving coat integrity. Clients report receiving countless compliments from neighbors when walking their styled pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Skillful and welcoming grooming staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The grooming team earns consistent accolades for friendly service and attentive communication from booking to pickup. Groomer Sandro receives particular acclaim for breed-specific clip expertise, helping pet parents choose safe blade lengths. Clients appreciate receiving timely phone calls or text notifications when pets are ready."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reasonable rates for Brooklyn pet owners"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients highlight that service fees are very competitive and affordable compared to other pet grooming establishments in Brooklyn. Reviewers feel the quality of styling, bathing, and nail trims provides excellent value for money. Transparent pricing and flexible same-day scheduling add to the positive customer experience."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Brooklyn Pet Spa groom long-haired cats?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, feline clients frequently visit for sanitary trims, gentle de-matting, and quick nail clipping."
      },
